OL,3,AIndia's opposition holds mega rally
OL,4,Aseeking election chief's resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people have
OL,7,Fgathered in Delhi for a major
OL,8,Fopposition rally demanding the
OL,9,Fresignation of India's chief election
OL,10,Fcommissioner.
OL,12,FThe rally, organised by the opposition
OL,13,FINDIA bloc and led by Rahul Gandhi's
OL,14,FCongress party, is taking place at
OL,15,FRamlila Maidan, a large ground in
OL,16,Fcentral Delhi known for hosting
OL,17,Fcultural events and political protests.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
