OL,3,AIndia's opposition holds mega rally
OL,4,Aseeking election chief's resignation
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisuals showed Gandhi in an open-top
OL,7,Fjeep alongside other opposition leaders
OL,8,Fheading towards the venue. The Gen
OL,9,FZ-led pressure group Cockroach Janta
OL,10,FParty (CJP) has also pledged support,
OL,11,Fthough its leaders have yet to be seen.
OL,13,FSecurity has been tightened, with
OL,14,Fthousands of police and paramilitary
OL,15,Fpersonnel deployed near the grounds.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
